  "body": "Title and CCC Issued.\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll to the beach, these beautifully designed brand-new homes offer an exceptional lifestyle in one of East Auckland's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of walking to Bucklands Beach Domain, Bucklands Beach Primary School, the scenic Bucklands Beach Coastal Walkway to Half Moon Bay, and Howick Golf Club. You're also just minutes from Half Moon Bay Marina, where you'll find cafés, restaurants, a gym, supermarkets, and ferry services to the CBD.\r\n\r\nBrand-new homes in this premium coastal location are becoming increasingly rare. Situated in the highly sought-after Macleans College and Bucklands Beach Intermediate school zones, these homes offer an exceptional lifestyle for families.\r\n\r\nConveniently located just a 2-minute walk to the bus stop, with direct bus services to Macleans College and Bucklands Beach Intermediate, commuting to school couldn't be easier.\r\n\r\nPerfect for families or professionals, offering:\r\n• 3/4 bedrooms, with the downstairs room consented as a study, which may be utilised as an additional bedroom if required.\r\n• Three upstairs bedrooms with a family bathroom\r\n• Guest powder room downstairs\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living flowing onto a private deck\r\n• One allocated car park\r\n• Four heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n• Underfloor heating in the bathroom\r\n• Quality kitchen appliances including oven, cooktop, rangehood, dishwasher, and waste disposal\r\n• Security intercom system and Alarm\r\n\r\nWhether you're a growing family, downsizer, or investor, these thoughtfully designed homes combine modern comfort with an unbeatable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nVisit our open homes or contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
